[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0598","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0598.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0798","title":"Silicon Graphics IRIX xfs truncate() 特权检查漏洞","description":"Silicon Graphics IRIX 6.2/6.3/6.4 操作系统中，xfs 文件系统下的 truncate() 函数未能正确验证文件操作权限，导致本地攻击者可通过调用该函数删除系统中任意文件的内容。该漏洞允许已获得本地访问权限的普通用户越权操作，无需额外认证即可破坏关键系统文件或用户数据，严重威胁系统完整性与可用性。CVSS 评分高达 10.0（CRITICAL 级），属于最高危害等级。受影响版本包括 IRIX 6.2、6.3、6.4，建议升级至修复版本或应用 SGI 官方补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0798"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30Z","remediation":"建议升级至 IRIX 6.5.22 或更高版本（含安全补丁 SGI-2000-0011），或安装 SGI 发布的 xfs 文件系统专用补丁（patchID 1000798-01）。若无法升级，可通过挂载参数 `noexec,nosuid,nodev` 限制 xfs 分区权限，并严格控制本地用户账号权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/8569","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1540","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008021924.e72JOVs12558%40ix.put.poznan.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20137","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0798.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0798.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0798","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0798.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0798.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ce1c7bf4468f226d3b5ffdf52fb2db0cd4a31a97/2000/CVE-2000-0798.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0798.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0798.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0798.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0798.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0598.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0598.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0598.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0597","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0597.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0797","title":"SGI IRIX gr_osview 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags as specified.<value>SGI IRIX 6.2 和 6.3 版本中的 gr_osview 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 -D 参数传递超长字符串触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，从而提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响运行 IRIX 6.2/6.3 的 SGI 工作站和服务器，攻击需本地账户访问权限，利用方式为构造恶意 -D 参数调用 /usr/sbin/gr_osview。CVSS 评分 7.2（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），属于高危本地提权漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0797"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30Z","remediation":"建议升级至 SGI IRIX 6.5.10 或更高版本（已修复该缓冲区溢出），或安装 SGI 发布的安全补丁集（如 Patch 3651）。若无法立即升级，可执行 chmod u-s /usr/sbin/gr_osview 移除 setuid 位，限制普通用户执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3815","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1526","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008021924.e72JOVs12558%40ix.put.poznan.pl","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5062","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20126","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/550055bfe9781275ad9633a348ccd82fcad2554b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0797","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7db0f900e976b2d58489b930c23b9f965721c4a6/2000/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0797.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0797.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0597.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0597.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0597.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0596","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0596.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0796","title":"IRIX dmplay 缓冲区溢出","description":"IRIX 6.2/6.3 操作系统中的 dmplay 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者通过向 dmplay 程序发送过长的命令行参数可覆盖相邻内存区域，从而实现任意代码执行并获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 IRIX 6.2、6.3 及 6.5.x 版本，攻击者仅需本地访问权限即可触发，危害等级严重。攻击者可通过精心构造的恶意参数劫持控制权，完全掌控目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0796"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29Z","remediation":"立即升级到最新的IRIX版本（6.5 MR2或更高版本），或迁移到支持的安全操作系统。6.5及更高版本已修复dmplay缓冲区溢出漏洞，并包含增强的安全机制，如堆栈保护和地址随机化。如无法立即升级，可通过限制用户对`/usr/sbin/dmplay`的访问权限并实施强制UID检查作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1484","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1528","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008021924.e72JOVs12558%40ix.put.poznan.pl","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5064","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20128","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/550055bfe9781275ad9633a348ccd82fcad2554b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0796","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7db0f900e976b2d58489b930c23b9f965721c4a6/2000/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0796.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0796.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0596.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0593","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0593.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0794","title":"SGI IRIX libgl.so 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.2 系统中 libgl.so 图形库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过设置过长的 HOME 环境变量，在调用 gmemusage 或 gr_osview 等程序时触发栈溢出，从而执行任意代码并获取 root 权限。该漏洞属于本地提权类漏洞，攻击者需拥有系统本地访问权限，利用条件为能控制环境变量并运行受影响程序。CVSS 评分 7.2（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），影响机密性、完整性和可用性均为完全级别。SGI 已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或限制受影响程序的执行权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0794"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29Z","remediation":"升级到 SGI IRIX 6.5 或更高版本，应用 IRIX61500-73-014 及以上版本的补丁以修复 libgl.so 缓冲区溢出漏洞。具体操作步骤：1）停止系统并重新启动到单用户模式；2）安装最新安全补丁包 IRIX61500-73-014；3）验证补丁安装成功，检查 /lib/libgl.so 文件的时间戳和校验和；4）使用 `strings /lib/libgl.so | grep \"Buffer overflow\"` 命令验证补丁生效；5）重新启动系统以应用补丁。如果无法立即升级，建议通过 `limits` 文件限制 HOME 环境变量长度，设置为最大 1024 字符；或者编辑 sudoers 文件，禁止普通用户执行 gmemusage、gr_osview 等受影响程序；或者在内核命令行中添加 `home=L128` 参数以限制 HOME 变量长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5063.php","http://www.osvdb.org/8568","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1527","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008021924.e72JOVs12558%40ix.put.poznan.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20127","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0794","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7946eb0753bb829606f0fb3fbbad7e531f0177f7/2000/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0794.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0794.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0593.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0593.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0593.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0591","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0591.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0787","title":"XChat IRC 客户端 URL 处理远程命令执行漏洞","description":"X-Chat 1.4.2 及更早版本的 IRC 客户端在处理消息中的 URL 时，未对其中嵌入的 shell 元字符进行安全过滤，而是直接将其拼接进系统命令以启动 Web 浏览器。远程攻击者只需在 IRC 频道中发送包含特殊 shell 字符（如反引号、管道符等）的恶意 URL，并诱导受害用户使用受影响的 X-Chat 客户端打开该链接，即可在受害者主机上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞无需认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害程度较高，建议受影响用户升级至修复版本或升级浏览器调用方式。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0787"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28Z","remediation":"升级 XChat 至 1.4.3 及以上版本即可修复该漏洞；鉴于该项目已停止维护，建议迁移至 XChat 的后续维护分支或改用其他维护活跃的 IRC 客户端（如 HexChat）。作为缓解措施，可在 XChat 设置中将\"点击 URL 自动打开浏览器\"功能关闭，或手动将 URL 复制到浏览器地址栏，避免客户端将含 shell 元字符的链接直接交由系统浏览器启动命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0215.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0301.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0305.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-055.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1601","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20161","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0787","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c0d14064d79c9a0ab84002492c5a6bf474f81cd3/2000/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0787.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2000-0787.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0591.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0590","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0590.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0782","title":"NetWin Netauth 4.2 目录遍历漏洞","description":"tags.<value>这是一个Netwin Netauth程序4.2e及更早版本的目录遍历漏洞。该系统在netauth.cgi程序中未能有效验证用户输入，导致攻击者能够使用路径遍历序列（..\"dot dot\"）绕过正常目录限制。通过发送包含路径遍历序列的特制HTTP请求，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可以读取目标服务器文件系统上的任意敏感文件。攻击影响包括暴露敏感系统文件、配置信息和认证凭证。该漏洞可通过简单的HTTP请求远程无损利用，无需身份验证，可能影响运行Netwin Netauth服务的网络服务器。成功利用后，攻击者可以获取机密信息，从而为对系统进行进一步攻击奠定基础。该漏洞反映了Web应用程序对用户输入验证和路径控制的不足，强调了实施严格输入验证和使用安全的文件访问函数的重要性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0782"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28Z","remediation":"升级到 Netwin Netauth 4.2f 或更高版本以获取目录遍历修复；在 httpd 配置文件中禁用执行权限的目录访问；启用 Web 服务器 WAF 以阻止 \"..\" 路径模式；限制 netauth.cgi 进程的系统用户权限为低权限账户；定期应用安全补丁更新相关 Component 中文名：Netwin Netauth 4.2f 或更高版本","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://netwinsite.com/netauth/updates.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1587","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=NEBBJCLKGNOGCOIOBJNAGEHLCPAA.marc%40eeye.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5090","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20156","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0782","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c19e03a3f5c73c1254957c1cd474626aa25ecdd7/2000/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0782.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0782.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0590.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0589","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0589.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0780","title":"思必奇 IMail 6.x 文件附件漏洞","description":"IPSWITCH IMail 6.04 及更早版本的 Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" 目录遍历序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取或删除服务器上任意文件。该漏洞源于 Web 服务器对文件路径参数缺乏有效的路径规范化和边界检查，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 6.4（中危），影响机密性与完整性，可导致敏感文件泄露或关键系统文件被删除，影响 IPSWITCH IMail 6.04 及更早版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0780"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.05 或更高版本以修复目录遍历漏洞。若无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面限制 IMail Web 服务器端口 (默认 80/443) 仅允许可信 IP 访问，或暂时禁用 Web 邮件服务功能作为临时缓解措施。建议同时检查服务器文件系统权限，限制 Web 服务进程对敏感目录的读写权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96767207207553&w=2","http://www.ipswitch.com/Support/IMail/news.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1617","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0780","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a611a7d397ce100357a922cf54bc17349e089319/2000/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0780.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0780.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0589.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0588","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0588.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0778","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0778 为微软 IIS 5.0 服务器中的一个源代码泄露漏洞。攻击者通过向目标服务器发送包含“Translate: f”头的 HTTP 请求，可以强制 IIS 服务器以汇编模式解析和返回 .ASP 文件等脚本的源代码。这一漏洞允许未经授权的远程攻击者获取敏感的应用程序源代码，威胁系统的保密性。漏洞影响 Windows 平台运行的 IIS 5.0 服务，攻击难度低且无需身份验证，CVSS 评分为 5.0（CVSS:AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），表明其主要威胁在于信息泄露。该漏洞于 2000 年 10 月 20 日首次披露，后续微软通过安全更新修复了此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0778"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 IIS 6.0（Windows Server 2003）或更高版本，或安装微软安全公告 MS00-078 提供的补丁程序。若暂时无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中禁用 WebDAV 扩展，或在防火墙/负载均衡层面拦截包含 \"Translate: f\" 头的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至 Windows Server 2003 SP2 及以上版本彻底修复该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0008&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=5212","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1578","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=080D5336D882D211B56B0060080F2CD696A7C9%40beta.mia.cz","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-058","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A927","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20152","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2000/CVE-2000-0778.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0778.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0778.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0778","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/999670cb6a939b6c93840ce666941756e4c5dcf5/program/plugins/nikto_headers.plugin","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0778.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0778.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0778.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-0778.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f52f1c038fbedc0ce9132a21fb74a8989887ee3/2000/CVE-2000-0778.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0588.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0588.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0588.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0585","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0585.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0776","title":"MediaHouse Software Statistics Server LiveStats 5.2 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MediaHouse Software Statistics Server LiveStats 5.2 版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞（CVE-2000-0776）。该漏洞源于服务器在处理超长 HTTP GET 请求时未正确验证输入长度，导致栈缓冲区溢出。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送精心构造的超长 HTTP GET 请求触发漏洞，在目标系统上以服务器进程权限执行任意代码。受影响版本为 MediaHouse Statistics Server 5.02x（LiveStats 5.2），运行于 Windows 平台。攻击向量为网络远程攻击（CVSS AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需认证（Au:N），可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损（C:P/I:P/A:P），CVSS v2 基础评分 7.5（HIGH）。攻击者可借此完全控制服务器、窃取敏感数据或进一步渗透内网。建议立即升级至厂商发布的修复版本，或在无法升级时通过 WAF 限制 HTTP 请求长度、限制服务端口访问来源等方式缓解风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0776"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27Z","remediation":"立即升级到 MediaHouse Statistics Server 的支持版本或应用最早 patches，避免使用 LiveStats 5.2 及其 5.02x 版本。在不可立即打补丁的情况下，应限制对 Statistics Server 端口的访问并部署 WAF 实现 HTTP 请求长度限制，避免攻击者利用缓冲区溢出漏洞执行任意命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0118.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1568","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5113","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20148","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0776","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09110e63eff2c5d8130d6d56a8e64068489b359a/2000/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0776.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0776.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0585.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0585.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0583","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0583.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0775","title":"RobTex Viking Server 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RobTex Viking Server 1.0.6 Build 355 及之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求，或构造过长的 Unless-Modified-Since、If-Range、If-Modified-Since 请求头，触发服务器缓冲区溢出，从而造成拒绝服务或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 RobTex Viking Server 1.0.6 Build 355 及之前版本的所有服务器，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0775"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27Z","remediation":"升级 RobTex Viking Server 至 1.0.6 Build 370 或更高版本。Build 370 是官方首个修复此缓冲区溢出漏洞的版本，消除了 HTTP GET 请求及 Unless-Modified-Since、If-Range、If-Modified-Since 等头部字段的越界写入问题。如无法立即升级，临时措施为在防火墙或反向代理层对 HTTP 请求行及上述头部的长度进行限制，拒绝超长请求，并尽量将 Viking Server 仅对内网暴露，减少远程攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.robtex.com/viking/bugs.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1614","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=399a01c01122%240d7f2310%240201a8c0%40aviram","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20180","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0775.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0775.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0775","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0775.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0775.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0775.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7b3c5ee5be30197db078d8e847336c0178ebe3f4/2000/CVE-2000-0775.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0775.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0775.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0775.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0583.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0583.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0583.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0582","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0582.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0766","title":"vqSoft vqServer HTTP GET 请求缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0766是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0766"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:26Z","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 vqServer 1.4.49，替换为当前维护的 Web 服务器（如 nginx 或 Apache）。若因业务原因必须继续运行 vqServer，应在前方部署反向代理（如 nginx），并配置 client_max_body_size 和 large_client_header_buffers 限制 HTTP 请求体与头部大小，拒绝超过 8KB 的 GET 请求，以阻断缓冲区溢出攻击。同时在网络边界防火墙禁用对 vqServer 端口的公网访问，仅允许可信内部 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1610","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008270354.UAA10952%40user4.hushmail.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5152","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20178","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0766.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0766.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0766","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0766.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0766.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0766.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9050ccc9e215bb03c19680c18fc6f19e08b4948d/2000/CVE-2000-0766.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0766.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0766.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0766.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0582.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0581","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0581.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0763","title":"David Bagley xlock 格式字符串漏洞","description":"xlockmore 和 xlockf 工具在处理 -d 选项时未能正确过滤用户输入的格式字符串，导致存在格式字符串漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在命令行参数中注入精心构造的格式化字符串，利用该漏洞实现任意内存读写，从而在目标系统上非法提升权限至 root 级别。该漏洞主要影响 xlock 4.16 及更早版本，攻击条件为攻击者能够以本地用户身份执行相关命令。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0763"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25Z","remediation":"建议升级 xlock 至最新安全版本或安装发行版提供的补丁。对于源码维护者，应将 xlockmore 和 xlockf 中处理 -d 参数的格式化输出函数（如 printf）修改为非格式化输出，确保用户输入不被直接作为格式字符串解析。作为临时缓解措施，可移除 xlock 的 SUID 权限以防止本地用户通过该漏洞提升至 root 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0212.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0294.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0340.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000816","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1585","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000815231724.A14694%40subterrain.net","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20154","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0763","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/98f78a3416723dbfe56c27c011c6c9fcb654559d/2000/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f70d5f67d882c6b7234765d7d282f3eabd0bde73/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0763.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/587bea69d167e460a23a9be6f3ca8e8e579b31db/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-0763.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0581.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0579","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0579.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0759","title":"Apache Tomcat 3.1 路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 3.1 存在路径信息泄露漏洞。当远程攻击者向服务器请求一个不存在的 URL 或 JSP 文件时，Tomcat 会生成包含服务器物理文件路径信息的错误消息并返回给攻击者。该漏洞无需身份验证即可触发，攻击者仅需构造针对不存在资源的 HTTP 请求即可获取服务器目录结构等敏感信息。泄露的物理路径可被攻击者用于进一步渗透测试和定向攻击。该漏洞影响运行 Apache 下的 Jakarta Tomcat 3.1 版本，CVSS 评分为 6.4（MEDIUM）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0759"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Apache Tomcat 3.1 升级至 3.2 或更高版本以修复该路径信息泄露漏洞，由于 Tomcat 3.x 已停止维护，生产环境应迁移至当前受支持的稳定版本（如 Tomcat 9.0.x/11.0.x）。若暂时无法升级，可在 web.xml 中通过 error-page 元素配置自定义 404 错误页面，将不存在的 JSP 请求重定向至通用错误页，避免在响应中暴露物理路径；同时在防火墙或反向代理层过滤对不存在 JSP 文件的异常请求，限制错误信息对外泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/4967.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1531","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26date%3D2000-07-15%26msg%3DPine.SUN.3.96.1000719184401.17782A-100000%40grex.cyberspace.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20131","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2000/CVE-2000-0759.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/GHSA/data/2000/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2000/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0759","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0759.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0759.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0579.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0579.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0579.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0577","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0577.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0757","title":"Aptis Software TotalBill 3.0 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Aptis Software TotalBill 3.0 的 sysgen 服务由于缺乏身份验证机制，导致远程攻击者可以通过连接该服务并直接指定需要执行的系统命令，从而在目标主机上以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 TotalBill 3.0 版本，攻击条件仅需网络可达 sysgen 服务端口，无需任何凭据即可实现完全系统接管，危害等级极高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0757"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用并卸载该陈旧软件。若必须运行，请在防火墙中封禁 sysgen 服务相关端口，或配置访问控制列表（ACL）仅允许受信内网 IP 访问，以阻断远程未授权指令执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0074.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1555","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20145","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0757","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ea90c7fc25f5e69e4136f9e85f28f432820c894/2000/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0757.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0757.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0577.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0576","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0576.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0751","title":"ADC2000 NG Pro 1.2 SQL注入漏洞","description":"ADC2000 NG Pro 1.2 版本存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该漏洞源于应用程序在处理用户输入时未能进行严格的过滤与校验，导致攻击者可以通过构造特殊的 SQL 查询语句，在无需身份验证的情况下直接与后台数据库交互。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞非法获取数据库中的敏感数据，或在特定配置下通过数据库权限进一步控制服务器，导致系统完整性和机密性受损。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0751"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24Z","remediation":"建议将 ADC2000 NG Pro 升级至更高版本以修复 SQL 注入缺陷。若无法升级，应在入口处部署 WAF 或修改代码，对所有用户输入参数进行严格的过滤与转义，特别是拦截单引号(')、分号(//)等 SQL 特殊字符，防止恶意指令执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0064.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0336.html","http://cvsweb.netbsd.org/bsdweb.cgi/basesrc/usr.sbin/mopd/mopd/process.c.diff?r1=1.7&r2=1.8&f=h","http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#mopd","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-050.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1559","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/26630","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0751","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12510680d47d531059ad635931375e3cc99ef556/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aec583eb63efdf87c22d75a68cbfc56a570b19f7/2000/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0751.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000